---
Set the worktree's changes aside, bring them back, or list them

Usage: specforge git stash <COMMAND>

Commands:
  push  Stash the changes of the index and the worktree, and clean the tree
  pop   Apply a stash (the newest when absent) and drop it
  list  The stashes, newest first
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
